              <div class=\"section-header\">\n                    New Products\n                    <span class=\"count\">8</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/huggingface/ml-intern\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ml-intern</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Hugging Face's open-source ML engineer that reads papers, trains models, and ships ML models - an AI agent that automates the entire machine learning workflow from research to production.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">GitHub Trending</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI workflow agent</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\"2,985 stars today - highest engagement among AI coding tools\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/Alishahryar1/free-claude-code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">free-claude-code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Use claude-code for free in the terminal, VSCode extension or via discord - makes Anthropic's Claude Code CLI accessible without subscription, similar to openclaw.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">GitHub Trending</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\"2,638 stars today - democratizes access to Claude Code CLI\"</d