lete and chat features in the IDE extension.\n   560→                    </div>\n   561→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   562→                        📅 April 17, 2026\n   563→                    </div>\n   564→                    <div style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">\n   565→                        <a href=\"https://github.com/continuedev/continue/commit/cb273098d968906d25ee737b454f0b5f13ea2482\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"highlight-link\">View Commit →</a>\n   566→                    </div>\n   567→                </div>\n   568→            </section>\n   569→\n   570→            <section class=\"technical-insights\">\n   571→                <h2>💡 Technical Insights <span class=\"count\">22</span></h2>\n   572→\n   573→                <div class=\"item\">\n   574→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   575→                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/24/deepseek-v4/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DeepSeek V4 Analysis</a>\n   576→                    </div>\n   577→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   578→                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> Chinese AI lab DeepSeek released frontier-level models at lower price points.\n   579→                    </div>\n   580→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   581→                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span>\n   582→                    </div>\n   583→                    <div class=\"topics\">\n   584→                        <span class=\"topic\">LLM</span>\n   585→                        <span class=\"topic\">open source</span>\n   586→                        <span class=\"topic\">China AI</span>\n   587→                    </div>\n   588→                </div>\n   589→\n   590→                <div class=\"item\">\n   591→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   592→                        <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/24/openai-gpt-5-5-release/