  625→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   626→                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/23/claude-code-quality/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Code Postmortem</a>\n   627→                    </div>\n   628→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   629→                        <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span> Quality issues caused by harness bugs, not models. Key bug caused older thinking to be cleared from idle sessions.\n   630→                    </div>\n   631→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   632→                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span>\n   633→                    </div>\n   634→                    <div class=\"topics\">\n   635→                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude Code</span>\n   636→                        <span class=\"topic\">bugs</span>\n   637→                        <span class=\"topic\">Anthropic</span>\n   638→                    </div>\n   639→                </div>\n   640→\n   641→                <div class=\"item\">\n   642→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   643→                        <a href=\"https://anthropic.com/design\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Design Documentation</a>\n   644→                    </div>\n   645→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   646→                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> Comprehensive Claude Design documentation covering prompt engineering, workflow patterns, and practical examples. 1170 points on HN.\n   647→                    </div>\n   648→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   649→                        <span class=\"author\">Anthropic</span>\n   650→                    </div>\n   651→                    <div class=\"topics\">\n   652→                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude</span>\n   653→                        <span class=\"topic\">prompt engineering</span