 class=\"topic\">AI agents</span>\n   842→                    </div>\n   843→                </div>\n   844→\n   845→                <div class=\"item\">\n   846→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   847→                        <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2026/4/22/google-ai-generated-code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google: 75% AI-Generated Code</a>\n   848→                    </div>\n   849→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   850→                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> Up from 50% last fall. Google created \"strike team\" to catch up to Anthropic (70-90% with Claude Code).\n   851→                    </div>\n   852→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   853→                        <span class=\"author\">Stevie Bonifield</span>\n   854→                    </div>\n   855→                    <div class=\"topics\">\n   856→                        <span class=\"topic\">Google</span>\n   857→                        <span class=\"topic\">AI coding</span>\n   858→                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude Code</span>\n   859→                    </div>\n   860→                </div>\n   861→\n   862→                <div class=\"item\">\n   863→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   864→                        <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2026/4/22/anthropic-mythos-breach\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anthropic Mythos Breach</a>\n   865→                    </div>\n   866→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   867→                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> Unauthorized group gained access to exclusive cyber tool Mythos. Described as \"humiliating\" breach.\n   868→                    </div>\n   869→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   870→                        <span class=\"author\">The Verge staff</span>\n   871→                    </div>\n   872→                    <div 