itle\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/Alishahryar1/free-claude-code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">free-claude-code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Free CLI tool bringing Claude Code capabilities to terminal with project context awareness and multi-file editing support. Achieved 3,975 stars on launch day.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">GitHub Trending</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\"3,975 stars in one day - clearly hitting a pain point\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/huggingface/ml-intern\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ml-intern</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Hugging Face's open-source ML engineer agent that can execute machine learning tasks, train models, and manage ML workflows autonomously. 1,236 stars on launch day.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">GitHub Trending</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\"Finally an open-source alternative to closed-source ML agents\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://producthunt.com/posts/instantdb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">InstantDB</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Complete backend with auth and storage in one prompt - generates APIs, schemas, and business logic from natural language. Featured prominently on Product Hunt.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\"Backend-in-a-prompt approach accelerates prototyping dramatically\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://producthunt.com/posts/cai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cai</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Press ⌥C on anything to run smart actions locally - AI-powered context menu for macOS that accelerates developer workflows with a universal hotkey.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\"Universal AI hotkey is a brilliant UX pattern\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/user/kimiflare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">kimiflare</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Kimi K2.6-powered CLI code editor running on Cloudflare Workers, bringing Chinese LLM capabilities to terminal-based development with zero-setup deployment.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/user/vibearound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">VibeAround</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Local AI agent that extracts context from IM conversations and browser activity to assist with coding tasks. Novel approach to context gathering.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\"Novel approach to context gathering from everyday workflows\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/user/seeknal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Seeknal</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Data & AI/ML CLI for managing datasets, running experiments, and orchestrating ML pipelines from the terminal. Fills gap for data science CLI tools.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\"Finally a CLI focused on data science workflows\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/user/wrangle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wrangle</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Markdown editor with native CLAUDE.md support for maintaining AI agent context and project documentation. Bridges gap between docs and AI.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\"CLAUDE.md support is exactly what the ecosystem needs\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://producthunt.com/posts/story-copilot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Story copilot</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Conversational AI interface to build intelligent workflows - transforms natural language into executable automation pipelines for developers.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\"Like ChatGPT for workflow automation\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/user/eol-dataset\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">EOL Dataset</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Dependency management tool that identifies end-of-life libraries and suggests migration paths using AI analysis. Solves security pain point.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\"Solves a real security pain point with dependency management\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/user/claude-context\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">claude-context</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        MCP server for intelligent code search and context retrieval, enabling better AI understanding of large codebases and monorepos.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">IDE-integrated AI tools</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\"Exactly what MCP needs - better context awareness\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://producthunt.com/posts/blankout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BlankOut</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Redact your docs on-device before sharing to AI - privacy tool that sanitizes code/docs before sending to external AI services. Essential for enterprises.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\"Essential for enterprises using external AI tools\"</div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <h2>✓ Whitelist Updates <span class=\"count\">5</span></h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        GitHub Copilot\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span> GPT-5.5 is now generally available for all GitHub Copilot users, bringing improved code generation and assistance capabilities.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        📅 April 24, 2026\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"highlight-link\">Changelog →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        GitHub Copilot\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span> Inline Agent Mode now available in preview for JetBrains IDEs, allowing developers to use Copilot's agentic capabilities directly within JetBrains.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        📅 April 24, 2026\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"highlight-link\">Changelog →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        GitHub Copilot\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span> Copilot Chat improvements for Pull Requests - enhanced capabilities for reviewing and understanding code changes more effectively.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        📅 April 23, 2026\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"highlight-link\">Changelog →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        GitHub Copilot\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span> Claude Opus 4.7 by Anthropic is now generally available in GitHub Copilot, providing access to one of the most advanced AI models for coding.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        📅 April 16, 2026\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"highlight-link\">Changelog →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        Continue\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span> Added support for Inception Labs' mercury-2 model, expanding available AI models for code autocomplete and chat features in the IDE extension.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        📅 April 17, 2026\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/continuedev/continue/commit/cb273098d968906d25ee737b454f0b5f13ea2482\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"highlight-link\">View Commit →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section class=\"technical-insights\">\n                <h2>💡 Technical Insights <span class=\"count\">22</span></h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/24/deepseek-v4/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DeepSeek V4 Analysis</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> Chinese AI lab DeepSeek released frontier-level models at lower price points.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">LLM</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">open source</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">China AI</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/24/openai-gpt-5-5-release/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GPT-5.5 Released</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> OpenAI's \"smartest and most intuitive\" model yet, continuing push toward AI super app.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Lucas Ropek</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">OpenAI</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">GPT-5.5</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">LLM</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2026/4/24/google-anthropic-investment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google's $10B Anthropic Investment</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> $10B initially, potential for $30B more. Amazon also invested $5B with potential for $20B more.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Jay Peters</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Anthropic</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Google</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">investment</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/23/claude-code-quality/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Code Postmortem</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span> Quality issues caused by harness bugs, not models. Key bug caused older thinking to be cleared from idle sessions.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude Code</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">bugs</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Anthropic</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://anthropic.com/design\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Design Documentation</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> Comprehensive Claude Design documentation covering prompt engineering, workflow patterns, and practical examples. 1170 points on HN.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Anthropic</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">prompt engineering</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">documentation</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://claudecodecamp.com/measuring-claude-4-7s-tokenizer-costs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude 4.7 Tokenizer Costs</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> Opus 4.7's new tokenizer increases tokens by 1.0-1.35x. For system prompts, 1.46x increase - roughly 40% more expensive.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Claude Code Camp</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">tokenization</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">pricing</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://bsky.app/post/3krgqkjnfvk2n\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Code Pricing Discussion</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type discussion\">Discussion</span> Discussion about Claude Code potentially being removed from Anthropic's Pro plan. Community debates pricing changes.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Hacker News community</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude Code</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">pricing</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Anthropic</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://qwen.ai/qwen3-6-27b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Qwen3.6-27B Performance</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> Flagship-level agentic coding in 27B model, surpasses previous 397B MoE. 55.6GB vs 807GB.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Qwen team</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">LLM</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">open source</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">coding</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://openclaw.ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OpenClaw-style CLI Usage Allowed</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> Anthropic reversed course and now allows OpenClaw-style CLI usage for Claude models.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">OpenClaw team</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">developer tools</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://blog.google/technology/infrastructure/eighth-generation-tpus-agentic-era\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google's Eighth-Gen TPUs</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> Two chips designed for \"agentic era\" - optimized for AI agents performing multi-step reasoning and autonomous tasks.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Google</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Google</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">TPU</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI hardware</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/24/anthropic-amazon-investment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Amazon's $5B Anthropic Investment</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> $5B invested with potential for $20B more. Anthropic pledged $100B in AWS cloud spending.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Rebecca Bellan</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Anthropic</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Amazon</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">investment</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://reuters.com/technology/meta-employee-ai-training\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Meta Employee Monitoring</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> Meta announced plans to capture employee mouse movements and keystrokes to train AI systems.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Reuters</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Meta</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI training</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">privacy</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://lucasgerads.com/spice-oscilloscope-claude-code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SPICE + Claude Code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> SPICE circuit simulation with oscilloscope verification using Claude Code for electronics design workflows.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Lucas Gerads</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude Code</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">electronics</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">SPICE</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/22/qwen3-6-27b/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Qwen3.6-27B Deep Dive</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> Flagship-level agentic coding in 27B model, surpasses previous 397B MoE. Generates SVG images of pelicans on bicycles.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">LLM</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">open source</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Qwen</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/22/firefox-mythos/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Firefox 150 + Claude Mythos</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> 271 vulnerability fixes from Claude Mythos Preview. \"Every bit as capable\" as top security researchers.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">security</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Firefox</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/22/github-copilot-pricing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Copilot Pricing Changes</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span> Agentic workflows fundamentally changed compute demands. Long-running parallelized sessions consuming far more resources.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">GitHub Copilot</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">pricing</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI agents</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2026/4/22/google-ai-generated-code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google: 75% AI-Generated Code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> Up from 50% last fall. Google created \"strike team\" to catch up to Anthropic (70-90% with Claude Code).\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Stevie Bonifield</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Google</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI coding</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude Code</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2026/4/22/anthropic-mythos-breach\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anthropic Mythos Breach</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> Unauthorized group gained access to exclusive cyber tool Mythos. Described as \"humiliating\" breach.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">The Verge staff</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Anthropic</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude Mythos</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">security</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2026/4/21/spacex-cursor-acquisition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SpaceX → Cursor $60B</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> SpaceX working with Cursor, option to buy for $60B. Shows massive valuations for AI coding tools.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Elizabeth Lopatto</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">SpaceX</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Cursor</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">acquisition</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/20/claude-token-counter/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Token Counter Update</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> Opus 4.7 uses new tokenizer. 1.0-1.35x increase, system prompts 1.46x increase. 40% more expensive.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">tokenization</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">pricing</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/19/headless-everything/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Headless Services Future</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span> API-first services becoming more common as personal AIs prefer APIs over GUIs. APIs ready for comeback.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">APIs</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">SaaS</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/18/claude-opus-system-prompts/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Opus System Prompts</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span> Analysis of differences between Claude Opus 4.6 and 4.7 system prompts. Only major lab to publish them.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">system prompts</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">LLM</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <a href=\"#\">About</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">Archive</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">RSS Feed</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">Contact</a>\n            <div style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\n                Generated by AgentDaily Research • 2026-04-25\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
